  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "After taking a detour down a long country road, Riley Hargrave's life takes a serious turn. Through the foreboding stormy night, a bolt of lightning strikes a nearby power line and crashes onto the hood of her car. \r\n\r\nRiley wakes up inside a mysterious old manor, with the front door missing its handle. Trapped inside the manor, her only option is to explore every room in search for a way out.\r\n\r\nBut some places are best left undiscovered..."
    }
